four-burner gas grill, on special buy for only $199, and entertain all season with the Hampton Bay West Grove's seven-piece outdoor dining set for only $499. This Memorial Day, get low prices guaranteed at the Home Depot. Lost supplies last. Priced invalid May 14th or May 27th.

